11.493-9.004 43.915-53.879 53-57.101v4.1A15814 15814 0 0 1 365.999 808.1h-12.901c-6.099-8.763-13.099-18.433-20.999-28.103-21.938 13.705-47.639 27.213-76.101 34.999-106.077 29.025-197.292-34.96-231.002-95.998-11.641-21.081-17.112-46.301-21.998-74.9-7.824-43.407 5.99-89.964 15.998-120.098 32.077-96.542 92.765-165.606 178.001-209.897 32.148-15.463 82.451-36.626 132.099-25.001 37.139 9.877 44.728 28.731 67.999 45.902a515 515 0 0 0 32.001-28.998h12.001Zm13 285.099h2.998a3935 3935 0 0 1-24.002 153.999c-10.767 12.23-22.435 23.565-34.098 34.9h-4.898v-6.901c7.234-41.764 13.568-84.439 19.902-127.999 13.666-17.101 27.333-35.102 40.098-53.999\"></path></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"f7\"><button type=\"button\"></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ff el\"><div class=\"fg em\"><nav><div class=\"fk\"><div class=\"fl\"><a href=\"/projects\">Projects</a></div><div class=\"fl\"><a href=\"/services\">Our Services</a></div></div><a class=\"fl\" href=\"/architect\"><div class=\"fm h3\"><div class=\"h4\">Claire Duchamp</div><div class=\"h5\">Architect</div></div></a><div class=\"fk\"><div class=\"fl\"><a href=\"/about-us\">About us</a></div><div class=\"fl\"><a href=\"/press\">Press</a></div><div class=\"fl\"><a href=\"/contact-us\">Contact</a><div class=\"fa h1\"><button title=\"French\" class=\"h2 no-scaling\" type=\"button\">fr</button><button title=\"English\" class=\"h2 no-scaling\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">en</button></div></div></div></nav></div></div></div><article class=\"j d3\"><div class=\"d4\"><div class=\"d6\"><div class=\"d7\"><h2>Lausanne Medical Practice</h2><h1>Art in the service of care</h1></div><button class=\"d8 af ah\" type=\"button\"><div class=\"ar\"></div><div class=\"ar\"></div><div class=\"ar\"></div><div class=\"ar\"></div></button><button class=\"d8 ab\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"></line><line x2=\"100%\" y1=\"100%\"></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"g9\"><button class=\"g8 eu\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x1=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\"></line><line x1=\"100%\" y1=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\"></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"er gb\"><div class=\"gc es et\"><div class=\"gd\"><div style=\"width:1090px\" class=\"gs ge\"><div class=\"gt\"><p>Renovation and decoration for a clinic in Lausanne.</p><p>95 m² SBPU</p></div><div class=\"gt gv\"><p>This renovation and interior design project transforms a medical practice in Lausanne into a warm and calming space, adapting residential design principles to the world of healthcare.</p><p>While respecting the functional requirements and hygiene standards specific to medical practice, the design prioritizes a sensitive atmosphere, enhanced by earthy tones and warm lighting.</p><p>Artworks on the theme of the human body punctuate the spaces and contribute fully to the identity of the place.</p><p>For this project in Lausanne, Claire Duchamp, a Swiss architect and interior designer, developed an approach focused on care, where architecture, art, and well-being converge.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"gf\"><img class=\"gg\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--couverture-1--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:2015/1440\"/></div></div><div class=\"gh es\"><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--01--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 1\"/><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--02--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 2\"/><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--03--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 3\"/></div><div class=\"gh es\"><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--04--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 4\"/><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--05--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 5\"/><img class=\"gi\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--06--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Picture 6\"/></div></div><div class=\"ga\"><button class=\"g8 ew\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><line x2=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\"></line><line x2=\"100%\" y1=\"100%\" y2=\"50%\"></line></svg></button></div><div class=\"db fr\"><div class=\"fs\" style=\"grid-template-columns:2015fr\"><img class=\"ft\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--couverture-1--©ClaireDuchamp.jpg\" alt=\"Lausanne Medical Practice – Art in the service of care – Cover\" style=\"flex-grow:2015;aspect-ratio:2015/1440\"/></div><div class=\"gs g5\"><div class=\"gt\"><p>Renovation and decoration for a clinic in Lausanne.</p><p>95 m² SBPU</p></div><div class=\"gt gv\"><p>This renovation and interior design project transforms a medical practice in Lausanne into a warm and calming space, adapting residential design principles to the world of healthcare.</p><p>While respecting the functional requirements and hygiene standards specific to medical practice, the design prioritizes a sensitive atmosphere, enhanced by earthy tones and warm lighting.</p><p>Artworks on the theme of the human body punctuate the spaces and contribute fully to the identity of the place.</p><p>For this project in Lausanne, Claire Duchamp, a Swiss architect and interior designer, developed an approach focused on care, where architecture, art, and well-being converge.</p></div><div class=\"fu\"><a href=\"/interior-architect-lausanne-medical-practice/1\"><img class=\"fv\" src=\"/img/projects/claire-duchamp-cabinet-medical-lausanne--01-thumbn